---
import SectionTitle from "../components/SectionTitle.astro";
---

<section
  class="min-h-full px-5 mb-10 pt-10 pb-6 bg-white-color flex justify-center items-center"
  id="services"
  data-scroll-spy
>
  <div class="container">
    <div>
      <SectionTitle title="Mis Servicios" classes="mb-10" />
    </div>
    <div class="mb-10">
      <p>Estos son los servicios que le ofrezco a mis clientes:</p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="services-container grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 justify-center items-center text-center"
    >
      <article class="services-card px-4 pb-10">
        <div
          class="services-img mb-6 text-first-color hover:text-second-color transition-colors duration-300"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="30"
            height="30"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              fill="currentColor"
              d="M20,3H7C5.897,3,5,3.897,5,5v2H4C2.897,7,2,7.897,2,9v10c0,1.103,0.897,2,2,2h6c1.103,0,2-0.897,2-2h8c1.103,0,2-0.897,2-2 V5C22,3.897,21.103,3,20,3z M6,9h4l-0.003,9H4V9H6z M12,17V9c0-1.103-0.897-2-2-2H7V5h11v12H12z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Diseño Web</h3>
        <p>
          Prototipo y maqueto tus diseños estaticos y los convierto en
          increibles sitios y aplicaciones web responsivas, optimas y
          accesibles.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="services-card px-4 pb-10">
        <div
          class="services-img mb-6 text-first-color hover:text-second-color transition-colors duration-300"
        >
          <svg
            width="30"
            height="30"
            aria-hidden="true"
            focusable="false"
            data-prefix="fas"
            data-icon="mobile-alt"
            class="svg-inline--fa fa-mobile-alt fa-w-10"
            role="img"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            viewBox="0 0 320 512"
          >
            <path
              fill="currentColor"
              d="M272 0H48C21.5 0 0 21.5 0 48v416c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h224c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V48c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48zM160 480c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32s14.3-32 32-32 32 14.3 32 32-14.3 32-32 32zm112-108c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12H60c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12V60c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h200c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v312z"
            >
            </path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Diseño Responsive</h3>
        <p>
          Tu sitio se mostrara en cada dispositivo, incluyendo computadoras de
          escritorio, tabletas y telefonos moviles.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="services-card px-4 pb-10">
        <div
          class="services-img mb-6 text-first-color hover:text-second-color transition-colors duration-300"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="30"
            height="30"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="currentColor"
          >
            <circle cx="12" cy="20" r="2"></circle>
            <circle cx="12" cy="4" r="2"></circle>
            <circle cx="6.343" cy="17.657" r="2"></circle>
            <circle cx="17.657" cy="6.343" r="2"></circle>
            <circle cx="4" cy="12" r="2.001"></circle>
            <circle cx="20" cy="12" r="2"></circle>
            <circle cx="6.343" cy="6.344" r="2"></circle>
            <circle cx="17.657" cy="17.658" r="2"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">WPO</h3>
        <p>
          Web Perfomance Optimization, hago que tus sitios y aplicaciones web
          mejoren su tiempo de carga y respuesta.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="services-card px-4 pb-10">
        <div
          class="services-img mb-6 text-first-color hover:text-second-color transition-colors duration-300"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="30"
            height="30"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              fill="currentColor"
              d="M10,18c1.846,0,3.543-0.635,4.897-1.688l4.396,4.396l1.414-1.414l-4.396-4.396C17.365,13.543,18,11.846,18,10 c0-4.411-3.589-8-8-8s-8,3.589-8,8S5.589,18,10,18z M10,4c3.309,0,6,2.691,6,6s-2.691,6-6,6s-6-2.691-6-6S6.691,4,10,4z"
            ></path>
            <path
              fill="currentColor"
              d="M11.412,8.586C11.791,8.966,12,9.468,12,10h2c0-1.065-0.416-2.069-1.174-2.828c-1.514-1.512-4.139-1.512-5.652,0 l1.412,1.416C9.346,7.83,10.656,7.832,11.412,8.586z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">SEO</h3>
        <p>
          Search Engine Optimization, optimizo tus sitios y aplicaciones web
          para que mejores tu posicion en los buscadores organicamente.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="services-card px-4 pb-10">
        <div
          class="services-img mb-6 text-first-color hover:text-second-color transition-colors duration-300"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="30"
            height="30"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              fill="currentColor"
              d="M16.018,3.815L15.232,8h-4.966l0.716-3.815L9.018,3.815L8.232,8H4v2h3.857l-0.751,4H3v2h3.731l-0.714,3.805l1.965,0.369 L8.766,16h4.966l-0.714,3.805l1.965,0.369L15.766,16H20v-2h-3.859l0.751-4H21V8h-3.733l0.716-3.815L16.018,3.815z M14.106,14H9.141 l0.751-4h4.966L14.106,14z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">SMO</h3>
        <p>
          Social Media Optimization y Marketing de contenido, te ayudo a elegir
          los canales digitales correctos para llegar a tu audiencia ideal.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="services-card px-4 pb-10">
        <div
          class="services-img mb-6 text-first-color hover:text-second-color transition-colors duration-300"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="30"
            height="30"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              fill="none"
              d="M4 15v4h16.002L20 15H4zM16 18h-2v-2h2V18zM19 18h-2v-2h2V18zM4 5v4h16.002L20 5H4zM16 8h-2V6h2V8zM19 8h-2V6h2V8z"
            ></path>
            <path
              fill="currentColor"
              d="M20 3H4C2.897 3 2 3.897 2 5v4c0 1.103.897 2 2 2h16c1.103 0 2-.897 2-2V5C22 3.897 21.103 3 20 3zM4 9V5h16l.002 4H4zM20 13H4c-1.103 0-2 .897-2 2v4c0 1.103.897 2 2 2h16c1.103 0 2-.897 2-2v-4C22 13.897 21.103 13 20 13zM4 19v-4h16l.002 4H4z"
            ></path>
            <path
              fill="currentColor"
              d="M17 6H19V8H17zM14 6H16V8H14zM17 16H19V18H17zM14 16H16V18H14z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold">Web Hosting</h3>
        <p>
          ¿No cuentas con dominio y hospedaje web para tu proyecto? No te
          preocupes, de esas cosas tecnicas me encargo yo.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* ----- Services Section ----- */
  .services-card:hover .services-img {
    color: var(--second-color);
  }

  .services-img svg {
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
</style>
